"Hi!\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for registering for the system. Visit this link to confirm your "
"email address and activate your account:\n"
"\n"
"https://www.yhrek.fi/accounts/activate/?activation_key=%(activation_key)s\n"
"\n"
"If you didn't request the account, DO NOT click on the link. If you have any "
"questions or concerns, please contact info@yhrek.fi.\n"
"\n"
"Best regards,\n"
"-- \n"
"Site administration"
msgstr ""
"Hej!\n"
"\n"
"Tack för din registrering i systemet. Öppna denna länk och bekräfta din e-"
"postadress och aktivera ditt användarkonto:\n"
"\n"
